			"updated": 1772836140113,
			"link": null,
			"locked": false,
			"text": "Key structure (SchemaKey)\nJSON properties on the wire:\n\n- magic (magicByte in code) – int\n        From SchemaRegistryKey. \n        For SchemaKey, always set to 1 via MAGIC_BYTE = 1. \n- keytype (keyType) – SchemaRegistryKeyType enum\n        ASSOC(\"ASSOC\"),\n          CONFIG(\"CONFIG\"),\n          SCHEMA(\"SCHEMA\"),\n          MODE(\"MODE\"),\n          NOOP(\"NOOP\"),\n          DELETE_SUBJECT(\"DELETE_SUBJECT\"),\n          CLEAR_SUBJECT(\"CLEAR_SUBJECT\"),\n          CONTEXT(\"CONTEXT\");\n\n- subject – String\n        Qualified subject name (may include context/tenant).\n\n-version – int (@Min(1))\n        The schema version under that subject. \n\n\n\n",
			"rawText": "Key structure (SchemaKey)\nJSON properties on the wire:\n\n- magic (magicByte in code) – int\n        From SchemaRegistryKey. \n        For SchemaKey, always set to 1 via MAGIC_BYTE = 1. \n- keytype (keyType) – SchemaRegistryKeyType enum\n        ASSOC(\"ASSOC\"),\n          CONFIG(\"CONFIG\"),\n          SCHEMA(\"SCHEMA\"),\n          MODE(\"MODE\"),\n          NOOP(\"NOOP\"),\n          DELETE_SUBJECT(\"DELETE_SUBJECT\"),\n          CLEAR_SUBJECT(\"CLEAR_SUBJECT\"),\n          CONTEXT(\"CONTEXT\");\n\n- subject – String\n        Qualified subject name (may include context/tenant).\n\n-version – int (@Min(1))\n        The schema version under that subject. \n\n\n\n",
			"fontSize": 20,
			"fontFamily": 5,
			"textAlign": "left",
			"verticalAlign": "top",
			"containerId": null,
			"originalText": "Key structure (SchemaKey)\nJSON properties on the wire:\n\n- magic (magicByte in code) – int\n        From SchemaRegistryKey. \n        For SchemaKey, always set to 1 via MAGIC_BYTE = 1. \n- keytype (keyType) – SchemaRegistryKeyType enum\n        ASSOC(\"ASSOC\"),\n          CONFIG(\"CONFIG\"),\n          SCHEMA(\"SCHEMA\"),\n          MODE(\"MODE\"),\n          NOOP(\"NOOP\"),\n          DELETE_SUBJECT(\"DELETE_SUBJECT\"),\n          CLEAR_SUBJECT(\"CLEAR_SUBJECT\"),\n          CONTEXT(\"CONTEXT\");\n\n- subject – String\n        Qualified subject name (may include context/tenant).\n\n-version – int (@Min(1))\n        The schema version under that subject. \n\n\n\n",
			"autoResize": false,
			"lineHeight": 1.25
		},
		{
			"id": "XkvAUrW69yfaW0Wjg8oeC",
			"type": "rectangle",
